  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Concerts? Brunch? Travel days? Our Sutton mini crossbody bag slips easily into all your plans, thanks to its compact size and adjustable strap for hands-free styling. Inside, two slip pockets keep your essentials organized and secure beneath a sleek snap closure. Crafted in pebbled leather, this everyday mini crossbody stands up beautifully to every adventure.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Pebbled Leather</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric lining</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Strap Drop: 22&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: 2 slip pockets</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Snap closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 8.9&quot; (L) x 5.2&quot; (H) x 2.40&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
